/S /H3
/T (Low-carbon biofuels are emerging as a key solution for reducing greenhouse gas \(GHG\) emissions, especially in sectors with low electrification feasibility, such as heavy transport, aviation, and maritime transport. The Technical Note highlights the potential of advanced fuels such as SAF \(Sustainable Aviation Fuel\) and HVO \(Hydrotreated Vegetable Oil\), which represent viable alternatives for advancing toward carbon neutrality in the region.)
/E (Low-carbon biofuels are emerging as a key solution for reducing greenhouse gas \(GHG\) emissions, especially in sectors with low electrification feasibility, such as heavy transport, aviation, and maritime transport. The Technical Note highlights the potential of advanced fuels such as SAF \(Sustainable Aviation Fuel\) and HVO \(Hydrotreated Vegetable Oil\), which represent viable alternatives for advancing toward carbon neutrality in the region.)
